</div>', NULL, 472000, 525000, 999, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0.0, 0, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 18:00:31', '2026-08-06 15:10:47', NULL, NULL, 'van tiết lưu mitsubishi lancer 2003-2005 ...', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 10, '', 5, 1000, '<ul>
